  "headline": "RSPAD Submits Health Results For Candidates Sugiono And Amran",
  "seoTitle": "RSPAD Submits Health Results For Sugiono And Amran",
  "metaDescription": "RSPAD Gatot Soebroto has finished health examinations for vice presidential candidates Sugiono and Amran Sulaiman, with results submitted to the MPR.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Gatot Soebroto Army Central Hospital (RSPAD) has completed comprehensive health assessments for vice presidential candidates Sugiono and Amran Sulaiman.",
    "The formal medical evaluation findings have been submitted to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) following a multi-stage testing process.",
    "Official disclosure regarding the status of both candidates' health results is scheduled to be released to the public on December 1."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The nomination process for a new vice president has prompted a series of mandatory medical evaluations for the candidates, Sugiono and Amran Sulaiman. These assessments were conducted at the Gatot Soebroto Army Central Hospital (RSPAD) involving a team of 25 medical professionals across 14 distinct testing stages. Following the completion of these evaluations, the hospital administration officially delivered the medical files to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR). Verification of personal details, including educational history at SMA Taruna Nusantara, has also been confirmed by government officials to ensure candidate eligibility. As political parties discuss the ideal profile for the position, candidates have expressed their focus on the administrative process, with final public announcements regarding the medical outcomes expected by December 1. These developments occur as institutional frameworks guide the replacement of the current vice presidential office.",
